Name and icon

Hangshot is based on Tendedero by Alejandro Buján
(https://github.com/alejandrobujan/tendedero). Hangshot has its own name
and its own icon, and is not Tendedero or endorsed by its author. In this
repository, scripts/make-icon.swift and the docs folder hold new artwork
made for Hangshot; the notice below, kept unchanged, refers to Tendedero's
original artwork, which is not included here.

Name and icon

The MIT License above covers the source code. It does not grant any rights
to the Tendedero name or the Tendedero icon, including the icon artwork drawn
by scripts/make-icon.swift and the images in the docs folder.

You may build and use the app as published, and you may refer to Tendedero
